Package: narrativecv
Title: Map Narrative CV Sections to Evidence in Open Research Infrastructures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Applies the Narrative CV Crosswalk, an open and versioned mapping
    between narrative CV frameworks (Résumé for Researchers, the Spanish CVA)
    and the records held by ORCID, OpenAlex, DataCite and the OpenAIRE Graph.
    Given an ORCID iD it reports, section by section, the evidence found, its
    coverage and its limitations, and which sections only the researcher's
    narrative can document.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/narrative-cv-crosswalk
BugReports: https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/narrative-cv-crosswalk/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite
